    <h1>FX TUNE Android Architecture Overview</h1>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        Fifth canonical knowledge asset. Documents the final component and data flow topology after
        the four blueprint items and anchors the remaining Phase Vocoder integration as a pure
        build-cache dependent step.
      </p>
    </blockquote>

