    <h3>JNI Bridge</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Direction</th><th>Component</th><th>Pattern</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr
          ><td>UI → Engine</td><td><code>AudioBridge.kt</code> ↔ <code>AudioBridge.cpp</code></td
          ><td>89 native methods, @Keep marked</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Engine → UI</td><td><code>onNativeEvent</code> callback</td><td
            >Telemetry push, event-driven</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Engine Parameters</td><td
            ><code>setBpm</code>, <code>setBypass</code>, <code>setMasterGain</code>, …</td
          ><td>Atomic, RT-safe</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Engine State</td><td
            ><code>getAnalysis</code>, <code>getCpuLoad</code>, <code>getBeatBuffer</code></td
          ><td>Snapshot, not callback-based</td></tr
        >
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Performance Guarantees (Verified)</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Metric</th><th>Guarantee</th><th>Mechanism</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr
          ><td>UI Latency</td><td>&lt; 16 ms (60 FPS)</td><td
            >State-Hoisting, isolated Recomposition, Canvas in Draw-Scope</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Audio Latency</td><td>&lt; 10 ms</td><td
            >Oboe LowLatency + Exclusive (AAudio MMAP when available)</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>CPU Efficiency</td><td>Load Shedding &gt; 92%</td><td
            >ADPF Hint-Sessions + <code>mLoadShedding</code> Atomic + Kotlin <code
              >set_buffer_pressure(4)</code
            ></td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>RT Safety</td><td>Compile-time enforced</td><td
            ><code>static_assert(std::atomic&lt;float&gt;::is_always_lock_free)</code> across all 4 ABIs</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>AI Inference</td><td>Async, non-blocking</td><td
            ><code>AiWorker</code>/<code>WhisperWorker</code>/<code>BarkWorker</code> worker threads,
            Lock-Free Queues</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Asset Size</td><td>8.2 MB TFLite savings</td><td
            ><code>ignoreAssetsPatterns += "!.jar"</code></td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>String Consistency</td><td>0 hardcoded UI strings</td><td
            >Full <code>stringResource()</code> coverage</td
          ></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td>Build Status</td><td>0 unresolved warnings</td><td
            >Documented, 5 IntelliJ inspector hints are KDoc tooling deficits</td
          ></tr
        >
      </tbody>
    </table>
